          "number": 3,
          "letter": "",
          "english": "By the 1850s, commercial trapping of passenger pigeons was proceeding at an __(31)__ pace. Hundreds of thousands of the birds were being harvested every day to be made into popular pigeon pies. In addition, large __(32)__ of the pigeons' nesting territory were being cleared away for planting crops and creating pasture land. As numerous as the passenger pigeons were, they were not an __(33)__ resource. By the 1880s, it was noticed that the bird population had become seriously __(34)__ . The last passenger pigeons killed in the wild were shot in 1899.",
          "chinese": "到19世纪50年代，旅鸽的商业捕猎以前所未有的速度进行。每天有数十万只旅鸽被捕获，用来制作广受欢迎的鸽肉馅饼。此外，旅鸽大片的筑巢领地也被清理出来，用于种植农作物和开辟牧场。尽管旅鸽数量众多，但它们并不是取之不尽的资源。到19世纪80年代，人们注意到旅鸽的数量已经严重减少。在野外被杀死的最后几只旅鸽于1899年遭到射杀。",
